              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Regulation\u202fZ does not require a change\u2011in\u2011terms notice when a credit\u2011card issuer raises a penalty rate that was already disclosed in the card agreement."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. PALMORE",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1a781cf6b6cc935e73c067af17d9a49e115e0c51477019d2608a5f2acaa77cab",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1a781cf6b6cc-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The staff commentary to Regulation\u202fZ requires that the specific maximum rate and the specific triggering events be disclosed in advance."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. PALMORE",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1a781cf6b6cc935e73c067af17d9a49e115e0c51477019d2608a5f2acaa77cab",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1a781cf6b6cc-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "If a rate increase is not tied to a specifically disclosed event, an advance change\u2011in\u2011terms notice is required."
      }
    ],
